Groupwise manipulation
Summarise by group:

penguins |&gt; 
    group_by(species) |&gt; 
    summarise(average_bill_length = mean(bill_length_mm))




# A tibble: 3 × 2
  species   average_bill_length
  &lt;fct&gt;                   &lt;dbl&gt;
1 Adelie                   NA  
2 Chinstrap                48.8
3 Gentoo                   NA  





penguins |&gt; 
    group_by(species) |&gt; 
    summarise(average_bill_length = mean(bill_length_mm, na.rm=TRUE))





# A tibble: 3 × 2
  species   average_bill_length
  &lt;fct&gt;                   &lt;dbl&gt;
1 Adelie                   38.8
2 Chinstrap                48.8
3 Gentoo                   47.5

